# Docetra frontend

- Pages stay thin. Lists: `WorkspaceEntityWorkspaceView` or `RecordAppRecordStageBoard`. Show/create: `DocumentEntityDocumentView`. Topics: `MeetingAppMeetingTopicBoard`. Do not add one-off scaffolds.
- All HTTP goes through adapters/repositories + `useApi()`. Paths: `frontend/app/utils/constants/api-endpoints.ts`.
- Dynamic types: `/meetings/{typeCode}` and `/records/{typeCode}` from surfaces catalog. Do not hardcode a Vue page per type.
- User-facing copy needs `en` and `km` i18n keys. Do not hardcode labels in pages.
- `NuxtPage` key is `route.path`, not `fullPath` (query changes must not remount).
- Cookie session + same-origin `/api/v2` proxy. Concurrency: `version` / `If-Match`.
- Verify UI in the browser when behavior or layout changed.

Details: `.opencode/skills/docetra/frontend.md` and `connection.md`.
